WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.920
This is Cook County Cooks, cookcountycooks.com.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.780
Every tool you use on the sales floor lives in this one

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.970
building. So let's take the tour.

00:00:11.826 --> 00:00:13.736
Getting around is easy.

00:00:14.246 --> 00:00:16.776
Scroll, and you walk from room to room.

00:00:16.886 --> 00:00:20.676
The menu across the top jumps straight to any room.

00:00:20.986 --> 00:00:25.726
Tap Find a tool to search by name, or hit the C³ button in the

00:00:25.746 --> 00:00:27.616
corner for the full list.

00:00:27.886 --> 00:00:30.716
Every tool opens right here on the site.

00:00:30.866 --> 00:00:33.876
Close it, and you're right back where you left off.

00:00:35.216 --> 00:00:39.056
First stop: The Pass. These are the tools you touch on every

00:00:39.076 --> 00:00:43.016
sale. The 6th Gen Mobile Quote Sheet builds a full Xfinity

00:00:43.036 --> 00:00:46.946
Mobile quote: lines, devices, trade-ins and promos.

00:00:47.056 --> 00:00:49.916
The Upgrade Quote Sheet prices out device upgrades for

00:00:49.936 --> 00:00:52.566
customers who already have Xfinity Mobile.

00:00:52.696 --> 00:00:56.016
New to a sheet? Each one has a short How To video right

00:00:56.036 --> 00:00:58.956
underneath it. The Internet Quote Sheet works out internet

00:00:58.976 --> 00:01:00.926
plans and bundle pricing.

00:01:01.276 --> 00:01:04.636
And T-Sheet Submissions keeps every quote you've submitted in

00:01:04.656 --> 00:01:07.526
one place, so you can track it and follow up.

00:01:08.957 --> 00:01:12.857
Next, the Host Stand. The screen up front shows today's mobile

00:01:12.877 --> 00:01:16.597
promo. The Daily Sales Report has every store's numbers for

00:01:16.617 --> 00:01:19.917
the day. And Yesterday's Conversion shows how yesterday's

00:01:19.937 --> 00:01:23.927
traffic turned into sales, store by store.

00:01:25.387 --> 00:01:29.097
In the Dining Room, the boards on the wall are live.

00:01:29.117 --> 00:01:32.327
Win the Weekend Chicago and Win the Weekend Big South are the

00:01:32.347 --> 00:01:36.427
weekend leaderboards. Who's on top, and what it takes to get

00:01:36.447 --> 00:01:37.077
there.

00:01:38.459 --> 00:01:41.932
The Prep Station holds the recipe cards for the tricky stuff.

00:01:41.952 --> 00:01:44.229
Print Outs has the forms and flyers,

00:01:44.279 --> 00:01:46.189
ready to preview and print.

00:01:46.479 --> 00:01:48.659
Credit Limit Increase sends a credit review when a customer

00:01:48.679 --> 00:01:50.849
needs more lines than their limit allows.

00:01:51.039 --> 00:01:53.519
The Exception Report shows the transactions that didn't go by

00:01:53.539 --> 00:01:56.259
the book. Request Access walks you through getting into

00:01:56.279 --> 00:02:00.089
Celestial, CSG, Einstein 360 and the rest.

00:02:00.199 --> 00:02:02.659
And the Fall-Off Summary shows sales that fell off before

00:02:02.679 --> 00:02:05.449
install or activation, so you can chase them back.

00:02:06.984 --> 00:02:10.024
The Training Room is where the how-to guides and product

00:02:10.044 --> 00:02:14.164
training live. The TV counts the days since each store's last

00:02:14.184 --> 00:02:17.784
bad NPS survey. BAPIS walks you through packing,

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:22.194
handing over and unpacking online orders picked up in store.

00:02:22.344 --> 00:02:25.164
Internet Essentials shows you how to set your Sales ID,

00:02:25.184 --> 00:02:28.344
so you get paid, then walks the customer through the

00:02:28.364 --> 00:02:31.904
application. Xfinity Product Mastery is the full product

00:02:31.924 --> 00:02:33.924
training, with a quiz at the end.

00:02:33.944 --> 00:02:37.484
CSG How To is step by step order entry,

00:02:37.504 --> 00:02:42.384
with the real screens. The Celestial Job Aid covers check-ins,

00:02:42.404 --> 00:02:46.354
sales, returns, and opening and closing the store.

00:02:46.604 --> 00:02:49.264
The eSIM Activation Guide gets any phone,

00:02:49.284 --> 00:02:51.314
tablet or watch onto Xfinity Mobile,

00:02:51.424 --> 00:02:55.044
QR codes included. And PortPro has account numbers,

00:02:55.064 --> 00:02:58.834
PINs and port-out steps for more than 20 carriers.

00:02:59.064 --> 00:03:02.274
A few of the how-to guides on the site need a passcode.

00:03:02.344 --> 00:03:03.714
Just ask your manager.

00:03:05.216 --> 00:03:07.216
Last stop: the Break Room.

00:03:07.236 --> 00:03:10.036
That's the Head Chef wall, this week's top performers from

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:13.686
every district. Tap a photo to see why they won.

00:03:14.156 --> 00:03:17.176
Commission Payouts shows what every sale pays out.

00:03:17.196 --> 00:03:20.316
The Rep Hourly Rate Estimate shows how your month is tracking,

00:03:20.336 --> 00:03:22.846
and what that works out to per hour.

00:03:22.876 --> 00:03:24.736
Got an idea, or a gripe?

00:03:24.756 --> 00:03:26.616
Drop it in the Suggestion Box.

00:03:26.636 --> 00:03:29.306
It's anonymous, and it goes straight to Jeff.

00:03:29.496 --> 00:03:32.776
The NPS Report shows Medallia scores by store,

00:03:32.796 --> 00:03:35.626
what customers are really saying about their visit.

00:03:35.896 --> 00:03:40.336
And when you're on break, the C³ Arcade has six games: Fox

00:03:40.356 --> 00:03:44.586
Run, After Hours, Deep Six, Blufox Overdrive,

00:03:44.756 --> 00:03:48.426
the Blufox Casino, and Windy City Derby.

00:03:50.147 --> 00:03:51.417
That's the whole kitchen.

00:03:51.777 --> 00:03:55.107
Cookcountycooks.com. Bookmark it, use it on every sale,

00:03:55.127 --> 00:03:56.697
and go win the weekend.
